# Artificial Evolution changes the text of Overlord of the Balemurk's spell, Avatar to Goblin (CR 612.1, 400.7a): its enters
# ability returns a "non-Goblin creature card", so Overlord of the Mistmoors, an Avatar, milled by it is a legal choice
# and Bot1 takes it. Mox Sapphire pays for the change, Jet and Ruby for the impending cost.

